    "contribution_label_zh": "替代光滑宏块构造",
    "contribution_note_en": "An alternative globally smooth macro-block construction and proof for the matching weighted gradient–Hessian query rate. The manuscript acknowledges that the same weighted rate follows from the existing hierarchical tradeoff construction, and emphasizes its globally C-infinity realization, delayed-disclosure argument, and explicit analytic and oracle accounting. The upper-bound algorithms are drawn from prior work.",
