    "novelty_scope_en": "Alternative construction and proof contribution; not a new independent weighted main-rate result or a dimension improvement over the cited hierarchical construction.",
    "novelty_scope_zh": "按替代构造与证明贡献展示；不标为新的独立加权主率，也不声称优于所引分层构造的维数要求。",
    "contribution_basis": "Current manuscript scope statements; no new priority adjudication or mathematical review."
