    "contribution_note_en": "A uniform two-sided formulation of exact-value complexity for nonsmooth strongly convex optimization using the Lipschitz slack Delta = L - mu*R. The manuscript treats the degenerate boundary, localized upper bounds and logarithmic factors, direct regularization transfer, and finite-dimensional endpoints. It explicitly recognizes that the large-dimensional polynomial lower profile agrees with the Euclidean specialization of prior strong-convexity reductions.",
    "contribution_note_zh": "以 Lipschitz 松弛量 Δ=L−μR 为核心，对非光滑强凸优化的精确函数值复杂度给出统一双边刻画，涵盖退化边界、局部化上界及对数因子、直接正则化转移与有限维端点。当前稿明确承认其高维多项式下界轮廓与既有强凸归约的欧氏特例一致。",
    "novelty_scope_en": "Uniform formulation, boundary geometry, localized upper-bound analysis and alternative proof; not a first large-dimensional polynomial lower-profile claim. Remaining logarithmic factors are not asserted sharp.",
    "novelty_scope_zh": "按统一刻画、边界几何、局部化上界分析与替代证明展示；不把重合的高维多项式下界标为首次新主率，也不声称剩余对数因子已经最优。",
    "contribution_basis": "Current manuscript scope statements; no new priority adjudication or mathematical review."
